<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 69.8282 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 69.8282 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 69.8282 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.8050 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 17		  Oct 16</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.8282		 69.8050</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	    1.180		   0.635</p>
<p>				    Oct 17		  Oct 14</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.7073		 45.8000</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	   0.055		   0.015</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
